      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.652,
            0.047,
            0.848,
            0.063
          ],
          "content": "Arithmetic Expressions"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.085,
            0.652,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": "**Example 17:** Given $53 \\times 18 = 954.$ Find out $6 3 \\times 1 8 .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.112,
            0.45,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": "As 63 × 18 means 63 times 18,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.131,
            0.406,
            0.204
          ],
          "content": "63 × 18 = (53 + 10) × 18 = 53 ×18 + 10×18 = 954 + 180 = 1134."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.213,
            0.715,
            0.236
          ],
          "content": "**Example 18:** Find an effective way of evaluating $9 7 \\times 2 5$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.239,
            0.42,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": "97 × 25 means 97 times 25."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.258,
            0.493,
            0.276
          ],
          "content": "We can write it as $( 1 0 0 - 3 ) \\times 2 5$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.276,
            0.849,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": "We know that this is the same as the difference of 100 times 25 and 3 times 25:"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.318,
            0.629,
            0.338
          ],
          "content": "9 7 \\times 2 5 = 1 0 0 \\times 2 5 - 3 \\times 2 5",
          "image_source": "images/page_17_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.343,
            0.335,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": "Find this value."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.37,
            0.621,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": "Use this method to find the following products:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.408,
            0.296,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": "(a) $9 5 \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.431,
            0.318,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "(b) $1 0 4 \\times 1 5$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.456,
            0.307,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": "(c) $4 9 \\times 5 0$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.486,
            0.848,
            0.507
          ],
          "content": "Is this quicker than the multiplication procedure you use generally?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.514,
            0.783,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": "? Which other products might be quicker to find like the ones above?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.504,
            0.905,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_17_image_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.544,
            0.294,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.57,
            0.848,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "1. Fill in the blanks with numbers, and boxes by signs, so that the expressions on both sides are equal."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.612,
            0.497,
            0.632
          ],
          "content": "(a) $3 \\times (6 + 7) = 3 \\times 6 \\pm 3 \\times 7$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.637,
            0.491,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "( 8 + 3 ) \\times 4 = 8 \\times 4 + 3 \\times 4",
          "image_source": "images/page_17_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.66,
            0.557,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": "(c) $3 \\times (5 + 8) = 3 \\times 5 \\boxed{\\quad} 3 \\times \\underline{\\quad}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.686,
            0.553,
            0.707
          ],
          "content": "(d) $(9 + 2) \\times 4 = 9 \\times 4$"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.447,
            0.971,
            0.551,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.712,
            0.512,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": "(e) $3 \\times ( \\frac{ 寳 }{ 寳 } + 4 ) = 3 \\frac{ 寳 }{ 寳 } + \\frac{ 寳 }{ 寳 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.735,
            0.518,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": "(f) $( \\frac{1}{2} + 6 ) \\times 4 = 13 \\times 4 + \\frac{1}{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.759,
            0.536,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "(g) $3 \\times ( \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}} + \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}} ) = 3 \\times 5 + 3 \\times 2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.783,
            0.545,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "(h) $( \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}} + \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}} ) \\times \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}} = 2 \\times 4 + 3 \\times 4$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.808,
            0.518,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": "(i) $5 \\times (9 - 2) = 5 \\times 9 - 5 \\times \\underline{\\hspace{1cm}}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.831,
            0.516,
            0.851
          ],
          "content": "(j) $(5 - 2) \\times 7 = 5 \\times 7 - 2 \\times \\underline{\\quad}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.855,
            0.556,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": "(k) $5 \\times (8 - 3) = 5 \\times 8 \\boxed{\\quad} 5 \\times$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
